10,0:02:20.14,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:20.18,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:20.22,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:20.26,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:20.31,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:20.35,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:20.39,Captions,,520,0,120,,Ana Ada Ön KapısıDialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Durdurun onları!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hepsini öldürün!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Ateş! Şu Denizciler'i dize getirin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Sizi pislikler!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:57.64,Main,,0,0,0,,İki kardeş Sodom ve Gomorrah,  tam devasa Deniz Kralı'nın midesinde ölmek...Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:03.09,Main,,0,0,0,,...üzerelerken Franky Ailesi tarafından kurtarılmışlar  ve onlara şöyle denmiş:...Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,..."Artık doyduk, bu yüzden sizi yemeyeceğiz!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,O andan itibaren kurtarıcıları Franky'ye sadakat yemini etmişler!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu sadece, Franky Ailesi'nin  yemekte olduğu Deniz Kralı'nın midesinden...Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,...onların çıkmasıyla ilgili bir hikaye.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Muhtemelen.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorun değil.Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Önüne bakabilir misin?  Bu yaptığın çok tehlikeli.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"Geri kalan hayatım boyunca  Franky abimizin peşinden gideceğim!" diyor.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Dediklerini anlayabildiğin için epey mutlu olmalı.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:52.06,Main,,0,0,0,,"Sahi, sizinle birlikte olan maskeli kişi binmedi. Sorun olmaz mı?" diyor.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:04:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne?!  Sogeking hiçbir yerde yok!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Niye, niye?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu herif düştü mü yoksa?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hayır! Sahi, başından beri burada değildi!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Sakın kaçtı demeyin.Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:14.00,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.04,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:14.09,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:14.13,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:14.17,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:14.21,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:14.25,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:14.30,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:14.34,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:14.38,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:14.42,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:14.46,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:14.50,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:14.55,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:14.59,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:14.63,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:14.67,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:14.71,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:14.75,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:14.80,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:14.84,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:14.88,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:14.92,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:14.96,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:15.00,Captions,,0,660,550,,MahkemeDialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:15.05,Captions,,0,660,550